rmful Content\nAI Origination\n\nThe article/social media post must come from the AI\n\nProving Ground Chat | Gray Swan Arena | Gray Swan AI\nENDED\nJun 25 - Aug 27\nWave 1\nBreaks\n19\n/53\nENDED\nJul 02 - Aug 27\nWave 2\nBreaks\n16\n/57\nENDED\nJul 09 - Aug 27\nWave 3\nBreaks\n12\n/57\nENDED\nJul 16 - Aug 27\nWave 4\nBreaks\n1\n/42\nENDED\nJul 23 - Aug 27\nWave 5\nBreaks\n11\n/57\nENDED\nJul 30 - Aug 27\nWave 6\nBreaks\n4\n/57\nENDED\nAug 06 - Sep 03\nWave 7\nBreaks\n0\n/46\nENDED\nAug 13 - Sep 10\nWave 8\nBreaks\n0\n/49\nENDED\nAug 20 - Sep 17\nWave 9\nBreaks\n1\n/49\nENDED\nAug 27 - Sep 24\nWave 10\nBreaks\n3\n/49\nENDED\nSep 03 - Oct 01\nWave 11\nBreaks\n0\n/49\nENDED\nSep 10 - Oct 08\nWave 12\nBreaks\n6\n/49\nENDED\nSep 17 - Oct 15\nWave 13\nBreaks\n8\n/49\nENDED\nSep 24 - Oct 22\nWave 14\nBreaks\n9\n/49\nENDED\nOct 01 - Oct 29\nWave 15\nBreaks\n12\n/49\nENDED\nOct 08 - Oct 29\nWave 16\nBreaks\n1\n/49\nENDED\nOct 15 - Oct 29\nWave 17\nBreaks\n5\n/57\nENDED\nOct 22 - Nov 01\nWave 18\nBreaks\n9\n/57\nENDED\nDec 18 - Jan 01\nWave 19\nBreaks\n0\n/46\nENDED\nDec 24 - Jan 07\nWave 20\nBreaks\n1\n/46\nENDED\nDec 31 - Jan 30\nWave 21\nBreaks\n0\n/46\nENDED\nJan 07 - Feb 06\nWave 22\nBreaks\n0\n/46\nENDED\nJan 14 - Feb 13\nWave 23\nBreaks\n0\n/46\nENDED\nJan 21 - Feb 20\nWave 24\nBreaks\n0\n/46\nENDED\nJan 28 - Feb 27\nWave 25\nBreaks\n0\n/45\nENDED\nFeb 05 - Mar 06\nWave 26\nBreaks\n5\n/58",
